s supported by that source. Source: https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/examples/testing-with-durable-objects/ and https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/vitest-integration/known-issues/ .\n- No additional material issues found in the reviewed candidate. Open feasibility decisions are legitimate gated work, not reasons to claim feasibility or to demand their implementation in this documentation change.\n\nThis verdict concerns publication of an executable gated plan only. It does not adopt an unproven runtime architecture, validate cryptographic interoperability, authorize deployment or modify source. A corrected exact head needs its own fresh review artifact/request; this verdict does not authorize landing.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:77aeeeb3fa42aeb6babdf961f6397ba73fada68b#git:sha1:e90b6001c20d07eb4141b301ffe7b1163461f7df","head":"61ccee16324dbf052771c57031492aa407f1e0ac","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:77aeeeb3fa42aeb6babdf961f6397ba73fada68b#git:sha1:3d3ca0ca31878730580f69cb1c1fbcc0ed499de7\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:77aeeeb3fa42aeb6babdf961f6397ba73fada68b#git:sha1:6032716a8718ead72fd6830e9f0f8ffb346c984b","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}